    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>signed integer of nBits bits, which must be a multiple of 64 and at least 256 (below that use <ref refid="group__GeneralGroup_1ga626821a3551ab1b67dc553a092bd0a2f" kindref="member">FastInt128</ref> and <ref refid="classMR_1_1Int64Mul128" kindref="compound">Int64Mul128</ref>); the product of two of them is exact, because it is twice as wide as the arguments; as <ref refid="group__GeneralGroup_1ga626821a3551ab1b67dc553a092bd0a2f" kindref="member">FastInt128</ref> it lacks conversion in double, sqrt-function and stream input/output </para>
    </detaileddescription>
